8	 * offset 4, so a receiver can read the type before it knows which struct it has.
9	 * All but the heartbeat carry origin_ns (CLOCK_MONOTONIC) at offset 8. Sizes are
10	 * fixed and checked below; a receiver validates type against length with
11	 * ipc_check_msg(). Fields are naturally aligned with explicit padding.
